<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 3 T-bill issues for 18.2 bln levs.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 3 T-bill issues for 18.2 bln levs.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed three special issues of discount T-bills worth a total of 18.2 billion levs and yielding 5.26, 12.87 and 21.21 and percent to maturity, respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issues mature in 13, 35 and 55 days, respectively.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issues were placed on Friday.</p>
<p>Details of issues follow. Prices in percent of par.</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Issue number	    BG3028997008  BG3029097006  BG3029197004</p>
<p> Type			discount	discount	discount</p>
<p> Term			55 days	 13 days	 35 days</p>
<p> Issue date		April 11	April 11	April 11</p>
<p> Maturity date	   June 5	  April 24	May 16</p>
<p> Par value		 2.5 bln levs  0.7 bln levs  15 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price	   82.50 pct     95.00	   88.60 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity     21.21 pct     5.26	    12.87 pct</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
